{
  "description": "Golden fee table for an online booking. The admin API (src/lib/pricing.ts, used by the payment order routes) and the customer site must both reproduce every row. Amounts are rupees; totalPaise is what the Razorpay order is created for.",
  "rules": [
    "effectiveAmount: null when isFree; else earlyBirdAmount when isEarlyBird and earlyBirdAmount is not null; else amount (null when the event has no price).",
    "A null effectiveAmount is never charged: the booking routes refuse to create an order.",
    "base: effectiveAmount x quantity for a ticket. For a competition the first member pays effectiveAmount and each further member pays groupExtraAmount, or effectiveAmount again when groupExtraAmount is null.",
    "couponDiscount is a flat amount off the whole order (not per person). discount = min(couponDiscount, base); discountedBase = max(0, base - discount).",
    "gst = gstEnabled ? round2(discountedBase x gstRate) : 0. platformFee = platformFeeEnabled ? round2(discountedBase x platformFeeRate) : 0. round2(x) = Math.round(x x 100) / 100.",
    "total = round2(discountedBase + gst + platformFee); totalPaise = Math.round(total x 100).",
    "Compare rupee fields to the paisa (|difference| < 0.005) and totalPaise exactly."
  ],
  "rates": { "gst": 0.18, "platformFee": 0.02 },
  "cases": [
    {
      "id": "ticket-x1-gst-and-fee",
      "event": { "isFree": false, "amount": 500, "isEarlyBird": false, "earlyBirdAmount": null, "gstEnabled": true, "platformFeeEnabled": true, "isCompetition": false, "groupExtraAmount": null },
      "quantity": 1,
      "couponDiscount": 0,
      "expected": { "effectiveAmount": 500, "base": 500, "discount": 0, "discountedBase": 500, "gst": 90, "platformFee": 10, "total": 600, "totalPaise": 60000 }
    },
    {
      "id": "ticket-x2-gst-and-fee",
